      "message": "Add Ztso extension definition\n\nAdd YAML definition for the Ztso (Total Store Ordering) extension.\n\nZtso provides TSO memory consistency semantics as an optional extension\nthat complements the baseline RVWMO model. It was ratified in January 2023\nas version 1.0.0.\n\nCloses #1204",
